Package: phi-adapter-thinq
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, phi-adapter-sdk (>= 0.29.0), phi-hostd (>= 0.0~git202610191200)
Recommends: phi-mosquitto, dnsmasq
Description: PHI LG ThinQ appliance adapter (local)
 LG ThinQ washers and dishwashers without LG's cloud: the box answers the
 module's bootstrap (phi-thinq-routed, HTTPS), takes it onto its own
 mosquitto, and this IPC sidecar sits on the device topics - answering the
 provisioning handshake, decoding the status frames and sending commands.
